    <text>
        <body>
            <div>
                <head>Translated parts</head>
                <p xml:id="CH1d0954-start">
                    <seg corresp="#CH1d0954_CHANT_006-8a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-10T11:17:58.801+09:00">This is named "dé qì" (脫氣, escaping *qi*).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1d0954_CHANT_006-8a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-10T11:17:58.801+09:00">When this person walks quickly, they pant and gasp.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1d0954_CHANT_006-8a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-10T11:17:58.801+09:00">Their hands and feet are cold and clammy.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1d0954_CHANT_006-8a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-10T11:17:58.801+09:00">Their abdomen is full.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1d0954_CHANT_006-8a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-10T11:17:58.801+09:00">In severe cases, they have loose stools (táng xiè).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1d0954_CHANT_006-8a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-10T11:17:58.801+09:00">Food is not digested.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1d0954_CHANT_006-8a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-10T11:17:58.801+09:00">The pulse is wiry and large.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1d0954_CHANT_006-8a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-10T11:17:58.801+09:00">Wiresness (xián) indicates reduction (of blood/*qi*).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1d0954_CHANT_006-8a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-10T11:17:58.801+09:00">Largeness indicates hollowness (kōng).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1d0954_CHANT_006-8a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-10T11:17:58.801+09:00">Reduction indicates cold (hán).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1d0954_CHANT_006-8a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-10T11:17:58.801+09:00">Hollowness indicates deficiency (xū).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1d0954_CHANT_006-8a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-10T11:17:58.801+09:00">Deficiency and cold fight against each other.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1d0954_CHANT_006-8a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-10T11:17:58.801+09:00">This is called "gé" (革, leather/change).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1d0954_CHANT_006-8a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-10T11:17:58.801+09:00">In women, it causes miscarriage and persistent bleeding.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1d0954_CHANT_006-8a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-10T11:17:58.801+09:00">In men, it causes loss of blood and seminal emission.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1d0954_CHANT_006-9a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-10T11:17:58.801+09:00"/>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1d0954_CHANT_006-9a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-10T11:17:58.801+09:00">For deficiency fatigue with urgency in the interior,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1d0954_CHANT_006-9a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-10T11:17:58.801+09:00">palpitations (jì),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1d0954_CHANT_006-9a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-10T11:17:58.801+09:00">nosebleeds (nǜ),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1d0954_CHANT_006-9a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-10T11:17:58.801+09:00">abdominal pain,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1d0954_CHANT_006-9a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-10T11:17:58.801+09:00">nocturnal emission (mèng shī jīng),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1d0954_CHANT_006-9a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-10T11:17:58.801+09:00">aching pain in the four limbs,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1d0954_CHANT_006-9a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-10T11:17:58.801+09:00">vexing heat in the hands and feet,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1d0954_CHANT_006-9a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-10T11:17:58.801+09:00">dry throat and mouth,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1d0954_CHANT_006-9a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-10T11:17:58.801+09:00">the Minor Constructing the Middle Decoction (Xiǎo Jiàn Zhōng Tāng) governs it.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1d0954_CHANT_006-10a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-10T11:17:58.801+09:00"/>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1d0954_CHANT_006-10a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-10T11:17:58.801+09:00">Formula for Minor Constructing the Middle Decoction:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1d0954_CHANT_006-10a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-10T11:17:58.801+09:00">Guìzhī (桂枝, Cinnamon Twig): three liǎng,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1d0954_CHANT_006-10a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-10T11:17:58.801+09:00">peeled;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1d0954_CHANT_006-10a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-10T11:17:58.801+09:00">Gāncǎo (甘草, Licorice Root): three liǎng,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1d0954_CHANT_006-10a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-10T11:17:58.801+09:00">roasted;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1d0954_CHANT_006-10a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-10T11:17:58.801+09:00">Dàzǎo (大棗, Jujube): twelve pieces;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1d0954_CHANT_006-10a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-10T11:17:58.801+09:00">Sháoyào (芍藥, Peony Root): eight liǎng;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1d0954_CHANT_006-10a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-10T11:17:58.801+09:00">Shēngjiāng (生姜, Fresh Ginger): two liǎng;</seg>
                </p>
            </div>
        </body>
